<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech CNB-120 index rises 16.5 points to 700.5 pts.</title>
<headline>Czech CNB-120 index rises 16.5 points to 700.5 pts.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CNB-120 index, a broad daily measure of Czech equities, rose 16.5 points on Monday to 700.5 points, the Czech National Bank (CNB) said.</p>
<p>Eight of the ten sectoral indices rose, with the investment funds index rising the most, up 48.6 points to 960.0.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
